sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant W as Worker session
  participant I as Integration / test target
  participant G as GitHub
  O->>O: Contract, base SHA, ownership, acceptance
  O->>W: Verified SSH + fresh bounded brief
  W->>W: Implement and test in isolated checkout
  Note over W: Close paid session on completion or dependency wait
  W-->>O: Diff/bundle SHA + small receipt + original logs
  O->>O: Review native/wrapper/outer exits and logs
  O->>O: Verify exact host/process group absence and diff
  alt More useful work is needed
    O->>W: New session with contract + work delta + outcomes
    W-->>O: Reviewed follow-up artifact and closure evidence
  end
  O->>I: Serial integration and authorized acceptance
  I-->>O: Combined checks and truthful evidence labels
  O->>G: Publish after required review and merge gate
